      <title>Down But Not Out; Baseball Takes Down Villanova with Seven Unanswered Runs</title>
      <link>https://lipscombsports.com/news/2026/2/21/down-but-not-out-baseball-takes-down-villanova-with-seven-unanswered-runs.aspx</link>
      <description>NASHVILLE – So far in Lipscomb's three wins, they all have one thing in common: coming from behind. On this Saturday from Ken Dugan Field at Stephen Lee Marsh Stadium, the Bisons rallied from their largest deficit of the season in six thanks to seven unanswered runs, including five in the sixth to take down Villanova University by a 9-8 score.</description>
