      <link>https://lipscombsports.com/news/2026/2/22/womens-golf-finishes-top-five-at-space-coast-classic.aspx</link>
      <description>VIERA, Fla. – Lipscomb Women's Golf finished tied for fifth out of 14 teams at the Space Coast Classic on Sunday. The Bisons were solid throughout the tournament, with round scores of 291, 294, 304 to finish (+25) on the event. Only one team in the field finished under par.</description>
